    "body": "Another option would be to add an additional variable to the format string. So rather than have a `$barnch` variable which is either the local branch or the local and remote branch we could have a `$remote` variable which is set to the remote branch. The format string would need to be changed to be something like `on [$symbol$branch(:$remote)]($style) ` but this might give the a bit more flexibility by allowing the user to change the symbol that separates the two branch names. These two variables could be truncated individually too. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
