    "updated_at": "2020-11-22T00:25:29Z",
    "body": "I went for the following format:\r\n```\r\nformat = \"on [$symbol$branch]($style)(:[$remote]($style)) \"\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt will not show the remote branch name if it is the same as the local branch, unless the user specifies it with `always_show_remote = true` in configuration file.\r\n\r\nThanks to the dedicated variable, one can custom the format easily, such as:\r\n```\r\nformat = \"[$symbol$branch]($style)(->[$remote](bold red)) \"\r\n```\r\nwhich yields\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8809698/99890592-335b3f80-2c61-11eb-923f-d8ccd61e0d26.png)\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
